Applications &amp; Demos
========================

Portable downloads for Windows. Prefer the **ZIP** (bundled runtime via jlink): unzip, then run `bin/AppName.bat`.

Conference slide decks live on the [Presentations](../presentations/index.html) page.

### Apps

| App | What it shows |
| --- | --- |
| [**EzDojo Manager**](EzDojo.html) | Real-world production desktop app built with JRebirth 12 |
| [**Mastering Tables**](MasteringTables.html) | Rich table / data-grid sample |
| [**Comparison Tool**](ComparisonTool.html) | Side-by-side comparison desktop tool |
| [**Showcase Demo**](Demo.html) | Modular demo embedding Wave, Todos, Workbench, FXML, Undo/Redo, FontIcon |
| [**Analyzer**](Analyzer.html) | Runtime wave analyzer |

### Embedded in Showcase Demo

These modules ship inside [Showcase Demo](Demo.html) — no separate home tiles:

* [Wave](Wave.html)
* [Todos](Todos.html)
* [Workbench](Workbench.html)
* [FXML](FXML.html)
* [Undo / Redo](UndoRedo.html)
* [FontIcon](FontIcon.html)
